s review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3125"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/63de0c6d5ba42989a476fd7c858d0b6d6bc7f13c98d22006eed9312aaa85f91a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/92/92b7fa703770b1f88f151e02e736daf1c6544ae42a20cad36b1de4b96f11952a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3127","characterName":"滝澤　流石","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3127"},"originalCharacterName":"滝澤　流石","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sasuga deserves his moniker as a troublemaker and community bad boy. Every definition a jock, he was once captain of the school hockey team until his wayward activities came to light. Also an otaku, though he hides the fact."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Taken from Nargrakhan's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3127"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/80/8009af0cfb60478f120f5b12cb5a1df65f947769641ac4c7f20b17314fbf3e5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5d/5d4331d6815b3fd8b3dbb6c538ddb2c55f2dd539c62f24fc53b1b63ff7ff1952.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c3128","characterName":"星野　奈々","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c3128"},"originalCharacterName":"星野　奈々","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":fals